    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but being still is the worst part. it’s just sitting in the dark watching the time go by. i don't want to wait for some \"new source\" that might never come. it feels like the story is already written and i've just reached the part where the character is just... done. there's no more plot. just this hollow feeling.",
